@host = http://localhost:5104

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Open an account (copy the "id" from the response into @ahmet below)
POST {{host}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currency": "TRY" }

###
@ahmet = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Pay in 100 TL
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{ahmet}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00, "currency": "TRY" }

### Balance
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{ahmet}}
